hi SPlussers --

running Splus5.1 under Irix 6.5, say i create the following S source
in my favorite editing function (e.g., tmp_vi(tmp)):

function()
{
        # comment 1
        if(T) {
                # comment 2
                x <- 1
                # comment 3
        }
        # comment 4
}

what i get after S reformats the source is:

function()
{
        # comment 1
        if(T) {
                # comment 2
                x <- 1
        }
}

even whole blocks of comments disappear.  this definately did not happen
under v3.x, and seems to go away if i use NULL's to make sure comments
aren't "touching" (i.e., either before or after) a closing brace.  did i
miss something about editing in v5.1?  have i been doing something wrong
all along?  thanks for any help.

- peter
